      "cml:premiseText": "asset means:  (a) any legal or equitable estate or interest in real or personal property, including a contingent or prospective one; and  (b) any right, privilege or immunity, including a contingent or prospective one."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-26-2-logic-descriptionlogic-3",
