      "cml:logicSummary": "The Minister must ensure that a functional separation requirements determination comes into force within 90 days after the end of the post-acceptance period.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5E) If:  (a) before the end of the period applicable under subclause (5), the ACCC accepts an undertaking given by Telstra under section 577A; and ... (f) the Minister must ensure that a functional separation requirements determination comes into force within 90 days after the end of the post-acceptance period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-66-ss-5e-logic-deontic-2",
