      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5EA) If:  (a) before the end of the period applicable under subclause (5), the ACCC accepts an undertaking given by Telstra under section 577A; and... (g) subclause (5) does not apply;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-66-ss-5e-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "subclause (5) does not apply",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "If the ACCC accepts an undertaking given by Telstra under section 577A, and certain conditions are met, subclause (5) does not apply.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5EB) Subclause (5) does not apply if:  (a) before the end of the period applicable under subclause (5), the ACCC accepts an undertaking given by Telstra under section 577A; and... (e) the undertaking does not require Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan."
    },
