      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must maintain functional separation principles",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The functional separation principles are as follows:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-74-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Maintain arm's length functional separation between wholesale/network business unit and retail business units",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the principle that Telstra should maintain arm’s length functional separation between:  (i) its wholesale/network business unit; and  (ii) its retail business units;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-74-ss-1-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Comply with final functional separation undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(d) the principle that Telstra should have systems, procedures and practices that relate to:  (i) compliance with a final functional separation undertaking;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-74-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
